291
00:19:29,049 --> 00:19:33,170
to deceptive reasoning probes that detect
strategic concealment, and

292
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:37,690
behavioral tests that reveal capability
overhang, this provides much

293
00:19:37,690 --> 00:19:41,089
stronger evidence than any single
approach. There are many

294
00:19:41,089 --> 00:19:44,329
more techniques, both behavioral and
internal, that we have

295
00:19:44,329 --> 00:19:48,609
not mentioned in this text. Comprehensive
evaluation approaches still

296
00:19:48,609 --> 00:19:50,609
need to be developed that use many of
these

297
00:19:50,609 --> 00:19:54,730
techniques together. No such comprehensive
test suite exists at

298
00:19:54,730 --> 00:19:55,650
